  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 86211e2fd74fb484598c1176279aee61, type: 3}
  m_Name: Natalia Dialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueColor: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0}
  startingNode:
    dialogueText: Greetings! Welcome to our humble hotel, what can I do for you?
    characterEmotion: 4
    characterReaction: 2
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 6774952781063389258
    isRootNode: 1
    editorPosition: {x: 368.60638, y: 67.00004}
    altDialoguePaths:
    - rid: 3046478936985567327
    guid:
      Part1: 801923639
      Part2: 1285914272
      Part3: 169959312
      Part4: 2761389138
    tag: 
  allNodes:
  - dialogueText: Greetings! Welcome to our humble hotel, what can I do for you?
    characterEmotion: 4
    characterReaction: 2
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 6774952781063389258
    isRootNode: 1
    editorPosition: {x: 288, y: 66.99999}
    altDialoguePaths:
    - rid: 3046478936985567327
    guid:
      Part1: 801923639
      Part2: 1285914272
      Part3: 169959312
      Part4: 2761389138
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: 'Why, thank you for choosing us, sir! It''s great to see people
      come in instead of passing by, for once.

      You can find your very own
      room no. 2 upstairs, quite near our beautiful, temporarily in reparations,
      sauna!

      Dinner will be served at 7pm, so please make yourself at home.'
    characterEmotion: 4
    characterReaction: 2
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 6774952781063389260
    - rid: 6774952781063389261
    - rid: 3046478936985567324
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 1199, y: 67}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 4028658863
      Part2: 1280522940
      Part3: 2166873217
      Part4: 985772993
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: 'Oh, I''m so glad to hear!

      You know... our chef, Andrey,
      hasn''t been feeling the best lately, and those news would <b>really</b> cheer
      him up.

      Would you mind telling him?'
    characterEmotion: 4
    characterReaction: 6
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 6774952781063389264
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 2396.0002, y: 150.00015}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 3035836761
      Part2: 1265355892
      Part3: 2035803023
      Part4: 4244752949
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: 'There, I''ve opened up the kitchen: it''s right next to the dining
      room behind me.

      Go right ahead and tell him.'
    characterEmotion: 0
    characterReaction: 0
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 1
    responses:
    - rid: 1630672535616487501
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 3518.0005, y: 174.00015}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 2805659445
      Part2: 1183585811
      Part3: 1197842849
      Part4: 3398019176
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: "Oh, a few guests went in and decided to have too much fun! Ha-ha!
      \nDon't worry, they won't be invited again. We'll repair it as soon as we find
      the keys.\nPlease, let me know if you find them somewhere around here."
    characterEmotion: 4
    characterReaction: 2
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 6774952781063389265
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 2430.0002, y: 466.00012}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 1012819177
      Part2: 1162638506
      Part3: 3147358645
      Part4: 705986296
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: 'Well, yes! But as of late the hotel has been getting more guests
      than usual!

      And by "as of late" I do mean today...

      And by "usual"
      I do mean zero...

      But I knew this would all turn around one day! And
      now we''ve got some real VIP guests blessing us with their presence.'
    characterEmotion: 1
    characterReaction: 6
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046478936985567307
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 2373.8672, y: -228.50003}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 1905733868
      Part2: 1129004607
      Part3: 2633351612
      Part4: 1809174617
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: 'Oh you haven''t heard? We have some top tier guests this evening!

      Oleg,
      a politician in the midst of his campaign and Aleksei, a once quite popular
      artist.'
    characterEmotion: 4
    characterReaction: 2
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046478936985567308
    - rid: 3046478936985567309
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 3460.8672, y: -228.50003}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 4209125068
      Part2: 1305821517
      Part3: 2972826264
      Part4: 2031857102
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: 'Right! He''s this pretty famous artist.

      Or at least he
      was...

      Now that I think of it I haven''t heard of any new paintings
      of his in a while.

      I''m not one to gossip, but maybe he got demotivated
      after that one article...'
    characterEmotion: 4
    characterReaction: 2
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046478936985567310
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 4444.6, y: -360.45}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 1261033585
      Part2: 1109877559
      Part3: 523396775
      Part4: 3925866868
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: 'You see, some journalist once accused him of being a... deviant,
      if you get what I''m saying.

      Normally I would deny entry to such queer
      folk but... you have to admit, the man is talented.

      Oh, how I dream
      of him making a painting with this hotel for all the world to see...!'
    characterEmotion: 1
    characterReaction: 2
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046478936985567312
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 5259.0015, y: -352.00012}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 3281136560
      Part2: 1341605581
      Part3: 2692599953
      Part4: 2335719801
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: 'Not as far as I''ve heard... though you know how much I hate to
      gossip.

      Why? Do you, perhaps... know who it was?'
    characterEmotion: 2
    characterReaction: 6
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046478936985567313
    - rid: 3046478936985567314
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 6342.2515, y: -354.7}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 171815091
      Part2: 1122010975
      Part3: 4256102025
      Part4: 267813150
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: 'Oh, let me guess, you say that because Oleg is jealous that Aleksei
      is getting the largest room, right?

      I knew it, I knew it, I knew it!

      I
      knew I had to find a way to make Aleksei liberate that room: priorities are
      priorities, you know?

      What will people say about my hotel if I can''t
      even give the best room to my most <b>distinguished</b> guest!'
    characterEmotion: 4
    characterReaction: 2
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046478936985567315
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 7287.587, y: -251}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 2642126672
      Part2: 1264286908
      Part3: 2451570350
      Part4: 3378827760
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: 'Well, she IS a reporter, and she casually seems to be in a place
      full of celebrities, so... I guess that is not a bad theory is it?

      Then
      again, she seems a bit too... serious to be going around besmirching the name
      of random artists.

      If she''s here for a reason, I bet it must be something
      far more important than that... and in my hotel... Oh, my, I think I might
      faint...'
    characterEmotion: 1
    characterReaction: 6
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046478936985567316
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 7256.4014, y: -579.1381}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 2923304815
      Part2: 1273307586
      Part3: 3503069355
      Part4: 2428477677
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: 'He''s this up and coming politician, quite the contentious person.
      I''m not one to gossip, but it seems the governent isn''t very fond of him.

      Either
      way, as far as I''m concerned, I quite like having such a prestigious guest.
      I wonder what made him choose us...'
    characterEmotion: 1
    characterReaction: 2
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046478936985567311
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 4433, y: -41.626137}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 1084635640
      Part2: 1239400926
      Part3: 3848048305
      Part4: 891342165
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: Yes?
    characterEmotion: 0
    characterReaction: 0
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 767062761356918899
    - rid: 767062761356918901
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 2356, y: 194}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 1434144360
      Part2: 1205454529
      Part3: 961528487
      Part4: 3504110837
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: Oh I hope you like it, I really do. You see, our chef, Andrey,
      hasn't been feeling the best lately. The hotel is never really busy but he
      seems to be contantly stressed out! Like a poor creature sensing a looming
      threat...
    characterEmotion: 0
    characterReaction: 0
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 767062761356918907
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 2972.9995, y: 194}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 2712483526
      Part2: 1300114989
      Part3: 1256677539
      Part4: 328751900
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: 'Really? Truly!? Oh how glad I am! Andrey is going to be so very
      happy to hear that. '
    characterEmotion: 0
    characterReaction: 0
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 767062761356918903
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 2985, y: 360}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 2590038319
      Part2: 1171197008
      Part3: 3063460023
      Part4: 3064970286
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: (Shush) Would you mind telling him? The kitchen is right next to
      the dining room.
    characterEmotion: 0
    characterReaction: 0
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 767062761356918908
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 3839.0005, y: 360}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 904673742
      Part2: 1248306800
      Part3: 1774973882
      Part4: 4284853093
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: So, yeah! If you do hear anything about the food, and I do mean
      anything, please let me know.
    characterEmotion: 0
    characterReaction: 0
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 767062761356918909
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 4439, y: 194}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 1474971684
      Part2: 1250302327
      Part3: 2767747491
      Part4: 2147173776
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: There, I've opened up the kitchen for you. Thanks!
    characterEmotion: 0
    characterReaction: 0
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses: []
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 4619, y: 360}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 2914108386
      Part2: 1110138228
      Part3: 608908179
      Part4: 2083506427
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: Oh no, no. It should say closed.
    characterEmotion: 0
    characterReaction: 0
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 767062761356918910
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 3231, y: 825}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 3981898683
      Part2: 1096800776
      Part3: 1487944366
      Part4: 3434827157
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: What? (God, am I really that distracted? I could've swear I put
      up the right sign) Don't you worry sir, I will- I will fix that up- right up-
      for you! Everything is just... swell.
    characterEmotion: 0
    characterReaction: 0
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 767062761356918911
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 3748, y: 827}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 3311561262
      Part2: 1237322432
      Part3: 1414774919
      Part4: 545376541
    tag: 
  isNotClue: 0
  _hiddenProof: 
