        tag: 
    - rid: 767062761356918878
      type: {class: DialogueResponse, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        responseText: '[And what led you to this place?]'
        nextNode:
          rid: 767062761356918883
        dialogueTopic: 
        m_conditions: []
        alreadyDisplayed: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 3687, y: -232.65594}
    - rid: 767062761356918879
      type: {class: DialogueResponse, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        responseText: '[I... didn''t get the pun.]'
        nextNode:
          rid: 767062761356918884
        dialogueTopic: 
        m_conditions: []
        alreadyDisplayed: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 3687, y: -57.655983}
    - rid: 767062761356918880
      type: {class: DialogueResponse, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        responseText: '[So that <b>camera</b> there is yours?]'
        nextNode:
          rid: 767062761356918885
        dialogueTopic: 
        m_conditions:
        - rid: 767062761356918886
        alreadyDisplayed: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 3687, y: 166}
    - rid: 767062761356918881
      type: {class: DialogueResponse, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        responseText: '[(Maybe that "business" is worth investigating...)]'
        nextNode:
          rid: -2
        dialogueTopic: 
        m_conditions: []
        alreadyDisplayed: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 6198, y: 431.99997}
    - rid: 767062761356918882
      type: {class: DialogueResponse, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        responseText: '[Which would be...?]'
        nextNode:
          rid: 767062761356918887
        dialogueTopic: 
        m_conditions: []
        alreadyDisplayed: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 6377, y: 864.9999}
    - rid: 767062761356918883
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueText: 'Well, a little, very trustworthy and fact-checked bird told
          me that they saw an important figure drive all the way this place.

          Which,
          by itself, should be suspicious, but it gets even MORE interesting when
          you realize that he was not <b>alone</b> in this car.

          My "bird"
          did not recognize this second man, but it would seem that this is more
          than just a simple vacation.'
        characterEmotion: 4
        characterReaction: 2
        doesItProveAnything: 0
        isKey: 0
        responses:
        - rid: 767062761356918888
        isRootNode: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 4032, y: -241.65596}
        altDialoguePaths: []
        guid:
          Part1: 2741510385
          Part2: 1272281206
          Part3: 642955931
          Part4: 3670528884
        tag: 
    - rid: 767062761356918884
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueText: 'Oh, sorry, my bad: I used to be a <b>food</b> critique, hence
          the <b>delicious</b> thing... Nevermind, it was bad anyways.

          Luckily
          for the staff here, I''m not anymore! My fingers would cram if I had to
          put into words the absolute trainwreck that was today''s lunch.

          That
          borshch was truly abhorrent... Who hired this Chef?'
        characterEmotion: 4
        characterReaction: 2
        doesItProveAnything: 0
        isKey: 0
        responses:
        - rid: 767062761356918889
        isRootNode: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 3970, y: -57.655983}
        altDialoguePaths: []
        guid:
          Part1: 43449678
          Part2: 1305780782
          Part3: 2148272541
          Part4: 4168384564
        tag: 
    - rid: 767062761356918885
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueText: '<b>DON''T LOOK AT IT!</b>

          I mean... yes, you''re
          right, but that doesn''t give you the right to just <b>take</b> it and
          examine it without permission.

          Not all the pictures there are
          for journalistic purposes, anyway...'
        characterEmotion: 0
        characterReaction: 0
        doesItProveAnything: 0
        isKey: 0
        responses:
        - rid: 767062761356918890
        isRootNode: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 4063, y: 166}
        altDialoguePaths: []
        guid:
          Part1: 1639345962
